{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>To roll upon us.</b> From the expression בגלל הדבר הזה — on account of the anger over the money returned in our sacks." "<b>And our donkeys.</b> If they were bringing only us alone, we would say we are being brought only to speak with us; but since even our donkeys are being brought with us into the house, it can only be to bring a false charge upon us."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:29.540823564Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}